/-!
# Natural Number Game: Tutorial World

My solutions to the Natural Number Game (https://adam.math.hhu.de/#/g/leanprover-community/nng4),
restated over Mathlib's `ℕ` so that they compile in this repository.

The game uses its own copy of the natural numbers (`MyNat`) and allows only a small set of
tactics in each world. Here I keep to the same tactics (`rfl`, `rw`, `nth_rewrite`) so the
proofs follow the game's spirit. Statements are the game's, proofs are mine.

New levels are added as I solve them.
-/

namespace NNG.Tutorial

end NNG.Tutorial
